# Scene2-1-b1

; ========================================
; ●シーン2-1-b1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我将倚靠在暖炉旁的<br>拨火棍拿到手里。|#0201Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是在这里闹事，我会没命的。|#0201Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那样的话，一切又将重蹈覆辙。<br>这是我必须避免的愚蠢行径。|#0201Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:道理我都明白。<br>即便如此——|#0201Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你错了。我不是邪恶。|#0201Bad01_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法忍受。|#0201Bad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果魔女真是绝对的邪恶，<br>那就必须将其铲除。|#0201Bad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
; @shake 5_1

[PrintTextModified Text:我凌空一跃，往前冲去——|#0201Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而。|#0201Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

; ＠備考◆ハッと息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0201Bad01_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我立刻停住了脚步。|#0201Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; TODO: インタラクティブ遷移
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:有一位少女<br>挡在了我的面前，阻拦了我的去路。|#0201Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:你打算做什么？|#0201Bad01_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……清除错误。|#0201Bad01_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我言简意赅地回答。|#0201Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的视线和敌意是针对艾玛……<br>不，是针对在场的所有人。|#0201Bad01_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的眼神明显不对劲。<br>如果你想伤害她们，<br>我绝不会坐视不理。|#0201Bad01_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅严肃地说道，手按在了腰间的武器上。<br>她竟然会在此刻介入，这让我有些意外。|#0201Bad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我为【与上次的不同】感到一丝惊讶，<br>同时也感到一股怒火正在心中升腾。|#0201Bad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅的口气，<br>说得仿佛我才是错误的存在。|#0201Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要妨碍我。<br>我的目标是……|#0201Bad01_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:0,3 Zoom:0.4 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:话到嘴边，我却卡住了。|#0201Bad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想看向原本打算攻击的目标——<br>看守，却发现自己根本做不到。|#0201Bad01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我试图转移视线，<br>却不知为何，目光完全无法从蕾雅身上移开。|#0201Bad01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这是你的魔法？|#0201Bad01_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对我的疑问，蕾雅只是淡淡一笑，<br>似乎并不打算回答。|#0201Bad01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是剥夺他人自由的魔法吗？<br>……不，身体可以正常活动。|#0201Bad01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是我的【视线】，<br>仿佛被一股力量【牵引】着，只能注视着蕾雅……|#0201Bad01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你能解除这个魔法吗？|#0201Bad01_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你愿意放下武器，<br>我随时可以解除。|#0201Bad01_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不过，看你的表情，<br>你似乎并没有这个打算。|#0201Bad01_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅微微苦笑。|#0201Bad01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你误会了。<br>我没有对你们出手的意图。|#0201Bad01_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来如此。<br>你的目标是那些怪物吗？|#0201Bad01_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，我也要阻止你。<br>那太鲁莽了……简直是自杀。|#0201Bad01_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0201Bad01_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心脏猛烈地跳动起来。|#0201Bad01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:“自杀”。<br>这个词，像火星般点燃了我的怒火。|#0201Bad01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我的职责是保护这里的每一个人。<br>如果你在这里乱来，会危及到周围——|#0201Bad01_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; TODO: インタラクティブ遷移
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_3 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅还在说着什么，但我已经充耳不闻。|#0201Bad01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自杀是错误的。<br>是最不可饶恕的罪行。|#0201Bad01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我绝不可能做出那种事。|#0201Bad01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可蕾雅却说，<br>我的行为是在自杀。|#0201Bad01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的内心，我所坚持的世界，<br>仿佛都在剧烈摇晃，几近崩溃。|#0201Bad01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:……不对，不是的。|#0201Bad01_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我要铲除魔女。<br>这绝非自寻死路。|#0201Bad01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果她要否定这一点，<br>如果她执意阻拦。|#0201Bad01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅，看来我必须让你吃点苦头了。|#0201Bad01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一股前所未有的强烈冲动涌上心头，<br>几乎要将我吞噬殆尽。|#0201Bad01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在无法抑制的情感驱使下。<br>我再次凌空一跃，挥起拨火棍，向蕾雅猛击而去。|#0201Bad01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

