[PrintTextModified Text:我顺势将拨火棍的尖端<br>抵在了她的脸上。|#0201Bad01_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，高高举起手臂——|#0201Bad01_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠夏目アンアン

[PrintTextModified Text:【住……住手】！|#0201Bad01_Unknown001| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnShake

; ＠備考◆動揺で息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:！？|#0201Bad01_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我即将挥下拨火棍的瞬间，背后传来一声呼喊。<br>同时，我的手臂也仿佛失去了控制般，停在了半空中。|#0201Bad01_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想要确认声音的主人，便将视线转向身后。|#0201Bad01_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……！？|#0201Bad01_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与我对上视线的安安，身体僵硬地颤抖起来。<br>是她发出的声音吗？|#0201Bad01_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:【不许动……！】|#0201Bad01_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安用命令的语气，对我喝道。|#0201Bad01_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（身体变得迟钝……）|#0201Bad01_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，并非完全无法动弹。<br>虽然全身如同灌了铅般沉重，<br>但还是能勉强一点点地活动手脚。|#0201Bad01_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然效果轻微，但这是操纵他人的魔法吗？）|#0201Bad01_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然有些棘手，但并非无法抵抗。|#0201Bad01_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0.1 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我迈着沉重的步伐，<br>向安安靠近。|#0201Bad01_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0.2 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……别过来，别过来啊！|#0201Bad01_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0.3 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:趁、趁现在……谁来，阻止她！|#0201Bad01_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

