[PrintTextModified Text:啧，真麻烦。|#0201Bad01_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知是受到安安的命令操控，还是出于自身意志，<br>亚里沙向前迈出一步。|#0201Bad01_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的左手，握着几根木柴。<br>应该是这房间里暖炉用的燃料。|#0201Bad01_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

