[PrintTextModified Text:我的魔法是【点火】。|#0201Bad01_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也可以这么用。|#0201Bad01_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

