[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙瞄准我，不停地投掷着燃烧的木柴。<br>对于躲闪不及的木柴，我挥舞拨火棍将其击落。|#0201Bad01_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是胡闹……<br>再这样下去，整个房间都会烧起来的！|#0201Bad01_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一切都为时已晚。<br>火焰已经蔓延开来，点燃了会客厅的家具和地毯。|#0201Bad01_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，亚里沙依然没有停止攻击，<br>似乎完全听不进我的劝告。|#0201Bad01_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:惊慌失措的少女们，<br>开始四处逃窜，想要逃离房间。|#0201Bad01_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

