[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香缓缓地，一步步向我们逼近。|#0201Bad01_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那是什么啊……|#0201Bad01_Alisa014| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到奈叶香现在的模样，亚里沙彻底呆住了，喃喃自语道。|#0201Bad01_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道说，她真的变成怪物了吗……？|#0201Bad01_Alisa015| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.25 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureNanoka.0-4

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的样貌发生了改变。|#0201Bad01_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:失去了血色，呈现出青白色的肌肤。<br>她的手，也变得不再像是人类的手，形状怪异。|#0201Bad01_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的表情扭曲而阴沉，<br>难以分辨是恐惧、绝望还是悲伤。|#0201Bad01_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那双如同流淌着黑色泪水的眼眸，<br>死死地锁定着我们。|#0201Bad01_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起……<br>对不起……|#0201Bad01_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:CreatureNanoka.0-4
@HideAllCharacters Duration:0.1 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，奈叶香的身影从我的视线中消失了。|#0201Bad01_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！？|#0201Bad01_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在我意识到不对劲的刹那。|#0201Bad01_Narrative107| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

