@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:耳边传来一阵令人毛骨悚然的声响。|#0201Bad01_Narrative108| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureNanoka.0-4
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……咳……|#0201Bad01_Alisa016| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香竟然一把抓住亚里沙的头颅，然后，<br>将其硬生生捏爆了。|#0201Bad01_Narrative109| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_9 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:CreatureNanoka.0-4

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起……<br>对不起……|#0201Bad01_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香如同行尸走肉般，机械地重复着这句话。|#0201Bad01_Narrative110| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——下一个就该我了吧。|#0201Bad01_Narrative111| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，我绝不会轻易束手就擒。<br>我紧紧握住手中的拨火棍，<br>准备战斗到最后一刻。|#0201Bad01_Narrative112| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊……<br>大家都会死……|#0201Bad01_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要……不要啊啊啊啊啊！|#0201Bad01_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香双手紧紧抱住自己的头，发出凄厉的嘶吼。|#0201Bad01_Narrative113| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的身姿，再度发生异变。<br>这一次，她已经彻底失去了人形。|#0201Bad01_Narrative114| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我理解了。<br>奈叶香已经堕落成了魔女。|#0201Bad01_Narrative115| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

