[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Bad01_Nanoka012| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香看向了我。|#0201Bad01_Narrative116| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

