[PrintTextModified Text:唔啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0201Bad01_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我怒吼一声，猛地挥舞起了拨火棍。|#0201Bad01_Narrative125| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

